          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not lie with mankind, as with womankind: it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abomination.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither shalt thou lie with any beast to defile thyself therewith: neither shall any woman stand before a beast to lie down thereto: it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "confusion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Defile not ye yourselves in any of these things: for in all these the nations are defiled which I cast out before you:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the land is defiled: therefore I do visit the iniquity thereof upon it, and the land itself vomiteth out her inhabitants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye shall therefore keep my statutes and my judgments, and shall not commit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of these abominations;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "neither",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "any of your own nation, nor any stranger that sojourneth among you:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(For all these abominations have the men of the land done, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before you, and the land is defiled;)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That the land spue not you out also, when ye defile it, as it spued out the nations that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For whosoever shall commit any of these abominations, even the souls that commit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be cut off from among their people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore shall ye keep mine ordinance, that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ye",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.18.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.18.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commit not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any one",
              "type": "text",
